---
description: >-
  Two pools, and a note declared outside both is associated with a task in
  each. The pools are pushed apart, and each note keeps the same clearance from
  its task, instead of the note on the task that moved overlapping it.
---
bpmn-beta LR
  pool p1 "Customer"
    task x "Place order"
  pool p2 "Shop"
    task a "Ship order"
  note m "Online or by phone"
  note n "Within two days"
  x --> a
  m ... x
  n ... a
